#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1408 expect=violation domain=AC
#note "Near-miss twin: AC carries the supplier ADDRESS (CAGTSUPA) but not the supplier NAME (CAGTSUPN) - the filter must key on the exact parameter code -> fires."
#library standard=sendig version=ar-1-0
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset AC label="Challenge Agent Characterization"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col ACSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col ACPARMCD type=Char label="Challenge Agent Parameter Short Name"
col ACPARM   type=Char label="Challenge Agent Parameter"
col ACVAL    type=Char label="Challenge Agent Parameter Value"
---
S1 | AC | 1 | CAGTSUPA | Challenge Agent Supplier Address | 1 Main Street
